# Belt-and-suspenders: this repo must NEVER contain Claude secrets or transcripts.
*.credentials*
.credentials.json
.claude.json
*.jsonl

# Derived from logs/*.log by bin/sj-catalogue.sh, rebuilt on every SessionStart/SessionEnd.
# The per-host logs can be tracked because each host only appends to its own (merge=union);
# a whole-file table has no such property and would conflict on every cross-machine rebase.
logs/CATALOGUE.md
